WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.595 --> 00:00:02.309
(light mystical music)

00:00:06.010 --> 00:00:07.199
- [Voiceover] Tampo.

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:09.090
- [Voiceover] When you're
not really angry at someone,

00:00:09.090 --> 00:00:11.017
but you're not really
happy about them either.

00:00:12.027 --> 00:00:12.888
- [Voiceover] Pambahay.

00:00:12.888 --> 00:00:14.296
- [Voiceover] A comfortable set of clothes

00:00:14.296 --> 00:00:16.821
usually worn at home,
away from judging eyes.

00:00:17.731 --> 00:00:18.710
- [Voiceover] Lambing.

00:00:18.710 --> 00:00:20.148
- [Voiceover] An intense tenderness,

00:00:20.148 --> 00:00:23.509
sweetness, and affection
rolled into one word.

00:00:23.509 --> 00:00:24.379
- [Voiceover] Papak.

00:00:24.379 --> 00:00:26.308
- [Voiceover] To eat a
food item that's usually

00:00:26.308 --> 00:00:28.027
eaten with rice on it's own.

00:00:29.097 --> 00:00:30.076
- [Voiceover] Gigil.

00:00:30.076 --> 00:00:31.707
- [Voiceover] An intense urge to pinch

00:00:31.707 --> 00:00:33.950
something or someone really cute.

00:00:33.950 --> 00:00:36.168
It could also be an expression of anger,

00:00:36.168 --> 00:00:38.396
so use with discretion.

00:00:38.396 --> 00:00:39.137
- [Voiceover] Pikon.

00:00:39.137 --> 00:00:40.389
- [Voiceover] Refers to people who are

00:00:40.389 --> 00:00:44.315
hot-headed, easily
angered, or sore losers.

00:00:44.315 --> 00:00:45.384
- [Voiceover] Umay.

00:00:45.384 --> 00:00:47.245
- [Voiceover] The feeling
of being satiated after

00:00:47.245 --> 00:00:49.994
eating a particular food
over and over again.

00:00:50.941 --> 00:00:51.609
- [Voiceover] Kilig.

00:00:51.609 --> 00:00:54.252
- [Voiceover] The feeling
of being on cloud nine,

00:00:54.252 --> 00:00:58.038
usually associated with romantic feelings.

00:00:58.038 --> 00:00:59.081
- [Voiceover] Torpe.

00:00:59.081 --> 00:01:00.673
- [Voiceover] A person who is too shy

00:01:00.673 --> 00:01:04.134
to express or pursue amorous desires.

00:01:04.134 --> 00:01:05.061
- [Voiceover] Lihi.

00:01:05.061 --> 00:01:06.941
- [Voiceover] An irrational
craving for something,

00:01:06.941 --> 00:01:09.510
often associated with pregnant women.

00:01:13.135 --> 00:01:14.974
(upbeat translucent music)

